Subject: [PATCH] standing_desk_height: mark intentional Omnidesk fallthrough

Separate upstream PR: https://github.com/tjhorner/esphome-standing-desk
Based on commit a60a3beca59b4ca8ffffa0e3fa542bc98535d3e9.
Exclude this patch from the Upsy Desky PR. The GPIO button feature does not
require it; the normal dependency remains unchanged until upstream releases it.

diff --git a/components/standing_desk_height/omnidesk_decoder.cpp b/components/standing_desk_height/omnidesk_decoder.cpp
index 5cad083..73c3e24 100644
--- a/components/standing_desk_height/omnidesk_decoder.cpp
+++ b/components/standing_desk_height/omnidesk_decoder.cpp
@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@ bool OmnideskDecoder::put(uint8_t b) {
       state_ = HEIGHT2;
       return false;
     }
+    [[fallthrough]];
   default:
     return UpliftDecoder::put(b);
   }
